# Filament's published assets — 4.2 MB of JS, CSS and fonts copied out of
# vendor/. Not committed, because they are a BUILD ARTEFACT of the installed
# package version, not source: keeping them in git means every Filament upgrade
# shows as thousands of lines of minified diff, and a stale copy silently
# disagreeing with the vendor code it came from.
#
# composer.json already runs `php artisan filament:upgrade` on
# post-autoload-dump, which republishes them, so `composer install` on the
# server regenerates all three directories. If the panel ever loads unstyled
# after a deploy, that command is what did not run.
/public/css/filament
/public/js/filament
/public/fonts/filament
